{"agent":"canned (no API key, nothing leaves this machine)","questions":["Why was my slowest session slow?","Which skill costs the most per activation?","Where do I wait on permission prompts the most?","How much time did API retries cost me?"],"schema":"Tables (DuckDB):\nspans(trace_id, span_id, parent_span_id, name, start_ns, end_ns, duration_ms, is_error, status_message, session_id, attrs JSON, resource JSON)\nspan_events(trace_id, span_id, name, time_ns, attrs JSON)            -- gen_ai.request.attempt\nevents(ts_ns, name, session_id, prompt_id, trace_id, span_id, request_id, tool_use_id, attrs JSON, resource JSON)\nmetric_points(name, unit, ts_ns, value, session_id, attrs JSON, resource JSON)\nViews: llm (llm_request span + api_request event on request_id), tools (tool span + blocked_on_user + execution), q_spans.\nMacros: a(json, key) -> string attribute, n(json, key) -> numeric attribute."}