{"answer":"The slowest session spent 998.1s in turns. Main-thread model time was 956.3s, tool execution 6.5s and permission waits 35.7s. 0 requests needed retries and 0 spans ended in error. Span sums overlap when tools run in parallel, so open a turn to see the exact split.","sql":"WITH turns AS (SELECT session_id, sum(duration_ms) AS turn_ms FROM spans WHERE name='claude_code.interaction' GROUP BY 1),\ns AS (SELECT session_id FROM turns ORDER BY turn_ms DESC LIMIT 1)\nSELECT t.session_id, round(t.turn_ms/1000,1) AS turn_s,\n  round(sum(sp.duration_ms) FILTER (WHERE sp.name='claude_code.llm_request' AND a(sp.attrs,'agent_id') IS NULL)/1000,1) AS model_s,\n  round(sum(sp.duration_ms) FILTER (WHERE sp.name='claude_code.tool.execution')/1000,1) AS tool_exec_s,\n  round(sum(sp.duration_ms) FILTER (WHERE sp.name='claude_code.tool.blocked_on_user')/1000,1) AS permission_wait_s,\n  count(*) FILTER (WHERE sp.name='claude_code.llm_request' AND n(sp.attrs,'attempt') > 1) AS retried_requests,\n  count(*) FILTER (WHERE sp.is_error) AS error_spans\nFROM turns t JOIN spans sp ON sp.session_id=t.session_id WHERE t.session_id IN (SELECT session_id FROM s)\nGROUP BY t.session_id, t.turn_ms","result":{"columns":["session_id","turn_s","model_s","tool_exec_s","permission_wait_s","retried_requests","error_spans"],"rows":[["697b88c2-3c8e-4712-a4ba-d1604172c2d3",998.1,956.3,6.5,35.7,0,0]]},"evidence":[{"trace_id":"4def16fd6ac0796e74263ce5f2b305c9","span_id":"44446288f9c2910a","label":"turn 7, 155.4s"},{"trace_id":"1a4bdacc64abea0eef60241eda6ddadb","span_id":"6e0bbf7de3778981","label":"turn 9, 128.7s"},{"trace_id":"17592ce63dfa1c7ef6853ac54fff8b3f","span_id":"a5a3bc34f9ac5a0a","label":"turn 2, 105.2s"},{"trace_id":"df5e935ab777ecfd467ba2293f5ee0c2","span_id":"1d6046bda6b68607","label":"turn 5, 95.8s"},{"trace_id":"7fb2233fed3a62e38e1076e5233612a5","span_id":"c70345aeae08b210","label":"turn 8, 95.6s"}],"builder":null}